WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.960
Am I meant to follow Jesus alone?

2
00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:07.720
Romans twelve says we’re one body

3
00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:08.380
in Christ,

4
00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:10.180
and members of one another.

5
00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:12.780
His mercy brings us into a life

6
00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:13.460
we share.

7
00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.400
Romans fifteen tells us to welcome each

8
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.160
other as Christ welcomed us.

9
00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:20.560
Christ didn’t live to please himself.

10
00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:22.760
Those who are strong are called

11
00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:23.920
to bear with the weak,

12
00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:25.780
helping them grow through Scripture.

13
00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:27.480
If you’re still learning,

14
00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:28.560
receive help.

15
00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:30.520
If you can strengthen someone,

16
00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:31.440
make time.

17
00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:34.180
Love makes room for people who need

18
00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:34.760
patience.

19
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:37.620
God is forming a people who glorify

20
00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:38.920
him with one voice.

21
00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:40.780
You’re invited to belong,

22
00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:42.100
to be cared for,

23
00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:43.580
and to help others grow.
